      "Stratagem§A Worthy Skull": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Khorne Daemonkin"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after a **BLOOD LEGIONS** or **WORLD EATERS** unit from your army has fought, and one or more enemy **CHARACTER** or **MONSTER** models were destroyed as a result of those attacks.\n\n**TARGET:** That **BLOOD LEGIONS** or **WORLD EATERS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** You gain D3BTP and you can then spend one or more BTP you have to activate one of the Blood Tithe abilities."
      },
      "Stratagem§Aggressive Disembarkation": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Goretrack Onslaught"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS RHINO** model from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** One **WORLD EATERS** unit embarked within your **RHINO** can disembark. When doing so, models in that unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield wholly within 6\" of your **RHINO** and can be set up within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units."
      },
      "Stratagem§Apoplectic Frenzy": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Berzerker Warband"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, just after a **KHORNE BERZERKERS** unit from your army is selected to Advance.\n\n**TARGET:** That **KHORNE BERZERKERS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the turn, your unit is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced."
      },
      "Stratagem§Aspire To Infamy": {
        "keywords": {
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Vessels of Wrath"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **WORLD EATERS CHARACTER** unit (excluding **EPIC HERO** units) is **selected to fight**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **WORLD EATERS CHARACTER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit's **CHARACTER** models' melee attacks have:\n\n- +1 **A**.\n\n- +2 **S**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Berzerker’s Wrath": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Berzerker Warband"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** One **KHORNE BERZERKERS** unit from your army that can make a **surge move** as a result of those attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Do not roll a D6 to determine how far models in your unit can move when they make a **surge move**. Instead, when making a **surge move**, those models can move up to 8\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Blessing of Burning Blood": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Khorne Daemonkin"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **BLOOD LEGIONS** unit from your army that is within 6\" of a friendly **WORLD EATERS** unit that was selected as the target as one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, models in your **WORLD EATERS** unit have a 5+ invulnerable save. If the Boon of Blood ability is active for your army, then until the end of the phase, models in your **WORLD EATERS** unit have a 4+ invulnerable save."
      },
      "Stratagem§Blood Offering": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Berzerker Warband"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS** unit from your army that was just destroyed while it was within range of one or more objective markers you controlled at the end of the previous phase. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one of those objective markers. That objective marker remains under your control until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§Bloodthirsty Horde": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Cult of Blood"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **JAKHALS** or **GOREMONGERS** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase and is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time your unit is selected to fight, when determining which models in it are eligible to fight, any models in your unit that are within 3\" of one or more enemy models are eligible to fight. When resolving those attacks, such models can target one of those enemy units that is within 3\" of them and within Engagement Range of their unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Bloody Vengeance": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Cult of Blood"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS MONSTER** or **WORLD EATERS TITANIC** unit from your army that was just destroyed by an enemy unit. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the battle, each time a model in a **JAKHALS** or **GOREMONGERS** unit from your army makes an attack that targets the enemy unit that just destroyed your unit, you can re-roll the Hit roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Brazen Idol": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Cult of Blood"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS MONSTER** or **WORLD EATERS TITANIC** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select the Idol of Infinite Rage, Idol of Burning Wrath or Idol of Blessed Blood. Until the start of your next Command phase, that Idols of Khorne ability is active for your unit instead of any other Idols of Khorne ability that is active for your army, even if you have already selected that ability this battle.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You can only use this Stratagem once per battle."
      },
      "Stratagem§Daemonic Fury": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Khorne Daemonkin"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **BLOOD LEGIONS** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one friendly **WORLD EATERS** unit within 6\" of your unit. Until the end of the turn, melee weapons equipped by models in your **WORLD EATERS** unit have the **[LANCE]** ability. If the Daemonic Rage ability is active for your army, then until the end of the phase those melee weapons also have the **[TWIN-LINKED]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Daemonic Resistance": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Possessed Slaughterband"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS POSSESSED** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Daemonic Strength": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Possessed Slaughterband"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS POSSESSED** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack made by a model in your unit is allocated to an enemy model, if your unit has the **EIGHTBOUND** keyword and that enemy model is not a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE,** add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack. If your unit has the **EXALTED EIGHTBOUND** keyword and that enemy model is **a MONSTER** or **VEHICLE,** add 1 to the Damage characteristic of that attack instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Daemontide": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Khorne Daemonkin"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one friendly **BLOOD LEGIONS** unit within 6\" of your unit. One destroyed **MOUNTED** model, up to D3 destroyed **BEAST** models, or up to D6 destroyed **INFANTRY** models are returned to that **BLOOD LEGIONS** unit with their full wounds remaining.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** This Stratagem cannot be used to return destroyed **CHARACTER** models to Attached units."
      },
      "Stratagem§Drawn to the Slaughter": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Cult of Blood"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **JAKHALS** unit from your army that was just destroyed. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** Add a new unit to your army identical to your destroyed unit, in Strategic Reserves, at its Starting Strength.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** This Stratagem cannot be used to return destroyed **CHARACTER** units to Attached units."
      },
      "Stratagem§Endless Pursuit of Violence": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Goretrack Onslaught"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS INFANTRY** unit from your army and one friendly **TRANSPORT** that it is able to embark within.\n\n**EFFECT:** If your **WORLD EATERS INFANTRY** unit is wholly within 6\" of that **TRANSPORT**, it can embark within it."
      },
      "Stratagem§Fail Not the Blood God": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Cult of Blood"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **JAKHALS** or **GOREMONGERS** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, re-roll a Hit roll of 1. If that model’s unit is within 6\" of one or more friendly **WORLD EATERS MONSTER** units, or within 9\" of one or more friendly **WORLD EATERS TITANIC** units, you can re-roll the Hit roll instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Frenzied Resilience": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Berzerker Warband"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack is allocated to a model in your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Stratagem§Full-Throttle Assault": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Goretrack Onslaught"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS RHINO** model from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a **WORLD EATERS** unit disembarks from that model after it has made a Normal move, that unit is still eligible to declare a charge this turn."
      },
      "Stratagem§Fury Unleashed": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Goretrack Onslaught"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS RHINO** model from your army that has one or more wounds remaining and was hit by one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** One **KHORNE BERZERKERS** unit embarked within your model can make a **disembark move** and then make a **surge move** of up to D6+2\".\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** A unit cannot be targeted by this Stratagem and the Unrelenting Advance Stratagem in the same phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§Hack and Slash": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Berzerker Warband"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase and that made a charge move this turn.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in your unit by 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§Horrifying Violence": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Possessed Slaughterband"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS POSSESSED** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each enemy unit within Engagement Range of your unit must take a Battle-shock test, subtracting 1 from that test."
      },
      "Stratagem§Immortal Fury": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Possessed Slaughterband"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS POSSESSED** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, do not remove it from play. The destroyed model can fight after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play."
      },
      "Stratagem§In the Shadow of Brass Idols": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Cult of Blood"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **JAKHALS** or **GOREMONGERS** unit from your army that was selected as the target as one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have the Feel No Pain 6+ ability. If your unit is within 6\" of one or more friendly **WORLD EATERS MONSTER** units, or within 9\" of one or more friendly **WORLD EATERS TITANIC** units, your unit has the Feel No Pain 5+ ability instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Murder-Call": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Khorne Daemonkin"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **BLOOD LEGIONS** unit from your army that is on the battlefield and not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Stratagem§Punish The Craven": {
        "keywords": {
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Vessels of Wrath"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent's Movement phase, when a unit is selected to make a **fall-back move**, if that unit is **engaged** with a friendly **WORLD EATERS CHARACTER** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **WORLD EATERS CHARACTER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** When an enemy unit **engaged** with your unit is selected to make a **fall-back move**, that enemy unit must use the **desperate escape** mode. If that enemy unit is **battle-shocked**, -1 from those **hazard rolls**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Rapid Manifestation": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Possessed Slaughterband"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **EXALTED EIGHTBOUND** unit from your army that is arriving using the Deep Strike ability this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6\" horizontally away from all enemy units.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** A unit targeted with this Stratagem is not eligible to declare a charge in the same turn."
      },
      "Stratagem§Skulls for the Skull Throne!": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Berzerker Warband"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after a **WORLD EATERS** unit from your army destroys a **CHARACTER** or **MONSTER** model.\n\n**TARGET:** That **WORLD EATERS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Make a Blessings of Khorne roll and use the results to activate one Blessing of Khorne. Until the end of the battle round, that Blessing of Khorne is active in addition to any other Blessings of Khorne that are currently active."
      },
      "Stratagem§Summoned by Slaughter": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Khorne Daemonkin"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, when the last model in a unit is destroyed, before removing it from play. (If that unit is a **TRANSPORT**, any units embarked within that **TRANSPORT** model must disembark first.)\n\n**TARGET:** One **BLOODLETTERS** unit from your army that is in Reserves.\n\n**EFFECT:** Set your unit up anywhere on the battlefield wholly within 9\" of that destroyed model and more than 6\" horizontally away from all enemy units, then remove the destroyed model from play.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You cannot use this Stratagem more than once per battle round."
      },
      "Stratagem§Unrelenting Advance": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Goretrack Onslaught"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS VEHICLE** model from your army that was hit by one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your model can make a Normal move of up to 6\".\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** A unit cannot be targeted by this Stratagem and the Fury Unleashed Stratagem in the same phase."
      },
      "Stratagem§Warp Stalkers": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Possessed Slaughterband"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge",
