      "Stratagem§Smash Through": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **WORLD EATERS VEHICLE** model from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time your unit makes a Normal or Advance move, it can move horizontally through terrain features.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Goretrack Onslaught"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Focused Ferocity": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **TERMINATOR SQUAD** unit is **selected to fight**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **TERMINATOR SQUAD** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s melee attacks have +1 **A**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Butchers Of Khorne"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§A Trophy for the Throne": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when a friendly **TERMINATOR SQUAD** unit is **selected to fight**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **TERMINATOR SQUAD** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s attacks that target a **MONSTER/VEHICLE** unit have +1 to **wound rolls**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Butchers Of Khorne"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Apoplectic Clarity": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly **DAEMON VEHICLE** unit is **selected to attack**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **DAEMON VEHICLE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit’s attacks can ignore modifiers to: \n\n- **BS**.\n\n- **WS**.\n\n- **Hit rolls** and **wound rolls**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Brazen Engines"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Goaded to Fury": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit that targeted a friendly **unengaged** **DAEMON VEHICLE** unit (excluding **TITANIC** units) has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** That **DAEMON VEHICLE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a **surge move** of up to D6\".",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Brazen Engines"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Trail of Destruction": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **DAEMON VEHICLE** unit is **selected to move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **DAEMON VEHICLE** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has **MOBILE**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Brazen Engines"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge",
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Scorn the Witch": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, when a friendly **WORLD EATERS CHARACTER** unit (excluding **EPIC HERO** units) suffers a **mortal wound**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **WORLD EATERS CHARACTER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has **Feel No Pain 4+** against **mortal wounds**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Vessels of Wrath"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Wrath Beyond Reason": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting Phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **TERMINATOR SQUAD** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **TERMINATOR SQUAD** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Ranged attacks that target your unit have -1 **D** until that enemy unit has attacked.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "World Eaters",
            "Butchers Of Khorne"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
