      "Ability§The Blood God’s Favour": {
        "text": "Each time you make a Blessings of Khorne roll, if this model is on the battlefield, you can re-roll up to six of the D6 rolled."
      },
      "Ability§Overwhelming Wrath": {
        "text": "_Aura_\n\nEach time an enemy unit within 6\" of this model is selected to Fall Back, that unit must take a Leadership test. If that test is failed, that unit must Remain Stationary this phase instead."
      },
      "Ability§Driven by Ultimate Rage": {
        "text": "_Aura_\n\nWhile a friendly **WORLD** **EATERS** unit is within 6\" of this unit, that unit’s melee attacks can:\n\n- Re‐roll hit rolls of 1.\n\n- Re‐roll wound rolls of 1."
      },
